description: Phase 1 scope and sources for the agency project tracker
alwaysApply: true
---

Before writing code, read in this order:
1. PRODUCT.md (scope and exclusions)
2. DESIGN.md (tokens, components, placement)
3. docs/shipright/build-rules.md (rules and open decisions)
4. docs/shipright/04-frontend-spec.md (the screen you are building)
5. The ticket in docs/shipright/05-feature-ticket-list.md

Rules:
- Build only Phase 1: S0 Sign in, S1 Projects, S2 Project form. Nothing in the "Excluded" lists.
- Use only values from DESIGN.md. No new colors, fonts, gradients or icons.
- If a decision in "Needs approval before build" is still open, stop and ask the owner. Do not pick one yourself.
- Keep money as numeric/decimal, never float. Health rules live in one function, getProjectHealth.
- Never claim a save worked without a success response.
